  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Suez Canal Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at deepening and widening of the existing canal with a view to increasing the maximum permissible draught from 11.6 meter to 16.1 meter.  It also included construction of a new by_pass at Port Said and procuring the necessary equipment to service the expanded canal.  All these elements were required to accommodate larger ships mainly tankers (150,000 tons fully laden).</narrative>
  </description>
